  "details": "Title: [Android] Text inside system IME input bar is invisible (White text on White background) after update\n\n​Category: Bug / Mobile / UI\n\n​Description:\n\nHi VRChat Team,\n\n​After the latest VRChat Android update, when typing in-game, the text inside the Android system IME input bar at the bottom becomes completely invisible.\n\n  \n\n​Issue Details:\n\n​The in-game chat box displays the typed text correctly, but the native system text field at the bottom renders with a white background and white text, making the characters invisible while typing (only the blue cursor is visible).\n\n  \n\n​Toggling system Dark/Light mode or changing keyboard themes does not solve the issue.\n\n​Device & System Info:\n\n​Platform: Android Mobile (VRChat Mobile)\n\n​Issue: Text color / UI contrast conflict on native IME text field\n\n​Please look into the UI/theme adaptation for the native text input component on Android. Thank you!",
